/-!
# Chirality of the actual source Clifford even algebra

The even algebra is generated by products of two existing source Clifford
operators. Its two quaternion factors and primitive central projections are
computed in that algebra. The two complex two-dimensional carriers are the
ranges of these projections. This is a statement about the fixed source
representation, not a classification of arbitrary Clifford algebras.
-/

@[expose] public section

noncomputable section

